1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:02,297
Mum hid the cookies on top of the fridge.

2
00:00:02,417 --> 00:00:02,845
Grow.

3
00:00:02,965 --> 00:00:03,904
Snack time.

4
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:05,137
Late for school?

5
00:00:05,387 --> 00:00:05,838
Grow.

6
00:00:05,958 --> 00:00:07,117
One giant step.

7
00:00:07,237 --> 00:00:09,104
Your best friend is looking for you.

8
00:00:09,224 --> 00:00:09,663
Grow.

9
00:00:09,783 --> 00:00:10,292
Again.

10
00:00:10,412 --> 00:00:11,013
Again.

11
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,861
Okay, that's terrifying.

12
00:00:13,142 --> 00:00:15,439
What if you could grow,
any time you wanted?

13
00:00:15,539 --> 00:00:17,139
One word, and you get bigger.

14
00:00:17,259 --> 00:00:18,546
As big as you like.

15
00:00:18,646 --> 00:00:19,771
Sounds amazing.

16
00:00:19,891 --> 00:00:21,445
Pigeons think you're a building.

17
00:00:21,565 --> 00:00:24,141
Your best friend gets
the best seat in town.

18
00:00:24,261 --> 00:00:26,105
And you're the coolest kid in the city.

19
00:00:26,355 --> 00:00:27,699
But here's the catch.

20
00:00:27,819 --> 00:00:30,859
Ten times taller means
a thousand times heavier.

21
00:00:30,979 --> 00:00:31,917
Your bones?

22
00:00:32,167 --> 00:00:34,174
Only a hundred times stronger.

23
00:00:34,294 --> 00:00:38,019
So every square inch of bone
carries ten times the load.

24
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:41,655
And a human thigh bone breaks at
about ten times your body weight.

25
00:00:41,775 --> 00:00:43,213
Your very first step?

26
00:00:43,463 --> 00:00:43,960
Snap.

27
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:44,890
That's real.

28
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,906
You sit down on a rooftop
and wait to shrink back.

29
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:51,424
The next morning, a man in a suit
is waiting in your kitchen.

30
00:00:51,544 --> 00:00:52,912
He has a photo of you.

31
00:00:53,032 --> 00:00:53,878
And an offer.

32
00:00:54,028 --> 00:00:55,803
Then the ceiling starts to crack.

33
00:00:55,923 --> 00:00:58,371
Upstairs, your little
sister just said the word.

34
00:00:58,471 --> 00:00:59,644
Do you run up and save her…

35
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:01,140
or do you keep your secret?
